OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy with a few bright
OL,6,For sunny spells. Mainly dry but
OL,7,Foccasional outbreaks of rain will
OL,8,Fspread from the west later in the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy evening and night
OL,12,Fwith outbreaks of rain, some of which
OL,13,Fwill be on the heavy side in the west.
OL,14,
OL,15,CSunday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain, some of which may
OL,17,Fbe briefly on the heavier side.
OL,18,FTurning drier later in the afternoon
OL,19,Fwith some brighter skies developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
